From 56d0f5d561b54fdbfd78b2c6a70e3c4de936cf7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 3 ax <3axmail@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:38:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(input): type non-Latin characters from the logical key

KeyEvent.text is empty for Cyrillic and other non-Latin layouts when the
backend has no text input (X11 without XIM, some compositors). The logical key
still carries the character, so use it when text is missing, in chat, signs,
books, anvils, search boxes, dialogs, options and the title screen. Ctrl and
releases never fall back.

Co-Authored-By: DeepSeek <noreply@deepseek.com>
